\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-6 \cellx4285\cellx8745\pard\intbl \pard\intbl\tqc\tx985\tqc\tx2695 \b\cf1 Chassis: \plain\fs20\cf1 Sensei\par\pard \pard\intbl \par\pard \pard\intbl\tqc\tx985\tqc\tx2695 The Sensei is what the Shadow should have been: bigger, tougher, and more weapon types. It was designed with the Command Bioderm in mind. It offers speed, sensors, varied weapons, and some protection.  Standard Equipment: Scout Sensor 22.8 Amplitude, a Fission 150 reactor, Bertrand-Altase targeting computer, Shield 600 shield class, Chemical 150 battery, Standard Life Support, 11cm armor, Pre-Flexive drive system, a jump capability of two, and secondary movement yield. Available at Tech level 1.\plain\fs20 \par\pard \pard\intbl \cell\pard \pard\intbl \pard\intbl\qc \{ewc MVBMP2, ViewerBmp2, !senseih.bmp\}\cell\intbl\row
